OL,3,GNEWSAOasis will not headline
OL,4,AGlastonbury 2027, organiser Emily Eavis
OL,5,Aconfirms
OL,6,
OL,7,FOasis may be back on tour next summer
OL,8,Fbut they will not be playing
OL,9,FGlastonbury Festival, according to
OL,10,Fco-organiser Emily Eavis.
OL,12,FThe band announced a series of 2027
OL,13,Fgigs across the UK, Ireland, Europe and
OL,14,Fthe US last week, leaving a potentially
OL,15,FGlastonbury-shaped hole in their
OL,16,Fcalendar.
OL,18,FOasis are due to play concerts at
OL,19,FManchester City's Etihad Stadium on the
OL,20,FFriday and Saturday of Glastonbury, but
OL,21,Fdon't currently have their own gig
OL,22,Fscheduled on the Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
