OL,3,GNEWSAOasis will not headline
OL,4,AGlastonbury 2027, organiser Emily Eavis
OL,5,Aconfirms
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis led some fans to conclude the
OL,8,FGallaghers may have been planning to
OL,9,Frock up at Worthy Farm's Pyramid Stage
OL,10,Fto close the event. But Eavis has put
OL,11,Fthose rumours to bed in a direct
OL,12,Fresponse to one Glastonbury-goer on
OL,13,Fsocial media.
